# Scenic drives: driving, not bathing

## User rule (standing)

For `place_type == scenic_drive` (Atlantic Road, Amalfi, PCH, Stelvio, …):

1. **Always drive** — character sets include **`window_down`** and **`cruise_through`** (when `cruise_through_ok`; bare alpine/desert passes may drop cruise and keep window_down).
2. **No swim / bikini / bathing** — no beach acts, no swimwear outfits, no Maya body-swim inject. Road clothes only.
3. Do **not** suggest beach/SUP/kayak/towel activities or bikini framing for these places.

Enforced in `generate_hero_images.py` (`pick_activity`, nature-pack scenic branch, outfit + swimwear gates).

## Commands

Prefer full character sets (fill to 5). Force only when debugging:

```bash
python3 generate_hero_images.py --eu --safe --character CHAR \
  --only-ids PLACE_UUID \
  --include-existing-cast --limit 1
```
